<title>USA: Equifax Inc Q4 shr $0.37 vs $0.30.</title>
<headline>Equifax Inc Q4 shr $0.37 vs $0.30.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>    Fourth quarter (Unaudited)	     1996	    1995</p>
<p> Operating revenue			  $487,611     $419,332</p>
<p>Income before provision</p>
<p>for income taxes:</p>
